    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:1SA:26:13",
      "sequence": 7919,
      "chapter_label": "1SA 26",
      "verse_label": "13",
      "locator": {
        "book": "1SA",
        "chapter": 26,
        "verse": 13
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "1SA",
          "chapter": 26,
          "verse": 13
        }
      ],
      "en": "Then David went over to the other side, and stood on the top of the mountain far away, a great space being between them;",
      "ko": "이에 다윗이 건너편으로 가서 멀리 산꼭대기에 서니 상거가 멀더라",
      "source_text_hash": "8c2ece613c094e22aff3afa8d749393fa900fff6dd2acf2d9f6c3e7fc73b8930",
