      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "1SA",
          "chapter": 26,
          "verse": 24
        }
      ],
      "en": "Behold, as your life was respected today in my eyes, so let my life be respected in the LORD’s eyes, and let him deliver me out of all oppression.”",
      "ko": "오늘날 왕의 생명을 내가 중히 여긴것 같이 내 생명을 여호와께서 중히 여기셔서 모든 환난에서 나를 구하여 내시기를 바라나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "2f6ccf746039325b93b5da748b61a82046764b4dfe3478d753d1430e74b3ed0b",
      "translation_text_hash": "e2322deadb60fe586121fb108e6d196ca980309e1f3a7f85ddcecb960bd0c21f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
